{"games":[{"id":8473958692,"name":"The Trials [PHASE 0]","desc":"Welcome, Participant! \nCompete against other participants in a lethal facility designed to kill all but one. It's your choice to decide whether or not to participate, but once you do, the choice is no longer yours. The Trials is a thrilling adventure game that requires some wit and skill to succeed. \n\nI made The Trials (BETA) in 2019 and have decided to bring it back for a full series! The beta was child's play, Phase 1 is only the beginning. Join the group to stay in the loop with updates! \n\n**WANT TO BECOME A VALID PARTICIPANT?** \n~Join ZELZ to get the Valid Participant name tag! Ranks will have more relevance to the game in the future features~","path":"/game/8473958692-the-trials","slug":"8473958692-the-trials","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ddf85312023575845366fad180debf340cbd2506c4421b7cbca72b6f172bcb3a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2ae8c64b8064da8550717e9d29961fb5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":10,"visitor":27123886,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-23T02:34:55.943Z","creator":{"name":"ZELZ","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":26838733,"name":"Catalog Heaven ","desc":"Battle with any Roblox-made gear from the avatar marketplace! Or customize your avatar!\n\nDefaults to R6 avatars since not all gear work with R15.\n\nDeveloped by Seranok. Catalog UI by Quenty. Maps by Maelstronomer, Agenttech, duncan779, Shedletsky, and Merely. \"You got bloxxed\" interface by Mazux.","path":"/game/26838733-catalog-heaven","slug":"26838733-catalog-heaven","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/10f45d22de5d41ea8453ca96930b4e479f7d6a505bf2c2941200f436bcf70047.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2ae1c08064751eb2accf3b330e90ca23/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":10,"visitor":246578767,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-08T09:18:01.939Z","creator":{"name":"Sky Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":6,"freeCount":6,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7603178367,"name":"[UPD] Chipotle Burrito Builder","desc":"Welcome to Chipotle Burrito Builder. Teleport back to the original Chipotle location in 1993, the year the Chipotle burrito was born. Use your skills to build and roll burritos like a true Chipotle crew member.\n\n🚨UPDATE🚨\nOpen CARD PACKS to unlock rewards, open all 53 for a free ENTREE or UGC Avatar Item from Chipotle!\n🎟️ENTER the Cinema!\n📷WATCH our NEW FILM!\n\nThe chance of receiving any card is equal.\nBurrito Bucks available in the Chipotle Burrito Builder experience have no monetary value and do not constitute currency or property of any type.\n\nAd","path":"/game/7603178367-chipotle-burrito-builder","slug":"7603178367-chipotle-burrito-builder","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/87417f43373ae5fb10bb61ee1c9b5de20867369ede1ce264ead85cea477ec7d4.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6ba1d493e9a1a1cd91e14db6f31ffca0/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":10,"visitor":38219083,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-09-15T21:23:59.130Z","creator":{"name":"Chipotle","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":7540727946,"name":" [CUSTOM GYM STATS] Hoops Life Basketball","desc":"🏀 Welcome to hoops life! A basketball game that offers new unique and distinctive features to the ROBLOX basketball community. 🏀\n\n🔥 Check out Season 3! 🔥\n\nBe FIRST 🏆 to experience new updates by pressing FOLLOW. On phone or tablet? Tap •••, then tap [🔔FOLLOW]\n\n👀 Join the Community Server to see leaks early 👀\n\nGame controls are in the menu ✅\nGame is available to all platforms ✅\n\n❌ We catch and ban cheaters. Don't cheat! ❌\n\nLeave a like 👍 and favorite ⭐ for more updates!","path":"/game/7540727946-hoops-life-basketball","slug":"7540727946-hoops-life-basketball","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3fd17a6695ed89dcf63e46701703b717d5aabe2eab643f4a22ad9158c880ed9c.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-938cf26e5b55ef54764182b1c2732248/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":10,"visitor":137261282,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-25T08:19:07.510Z","creator":{"name":"Hoops Life","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":12,"freeCount":12,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":4878988249,"name":"[ANNIV+MUAY/WU] Mighty Omega","desc":"Based on a manga and our previous game!\n\nBasic Controls :\n\nDouble tap 'W' to RUN \nWhile running pressing 'R' will toggle between jog/sprinting\n'Q' to DASH\nHold F with your combat style tool to BLOCK\nF + LMB for perfect block on guard break move\nF + RMB for counter on any hit\nLMB for attacking\nRMB for GUARD BREAK\n\nDevelopers :\n- IncredibleAyum, Yolomura, \nstreetjess, MisterAokiji, dodorider, IncredibleJuIes\n\nContributors :\n- MoltenPrime, Tacomura\n\nPremium players have a +8% stat gain boost","path":"/game/4878988249-mighty-omega","slug":"4878988249-mighty-omega","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d6ab265526e55195cc409f9a1a5a379dfe45dec124b4243419127dca36858958.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-87249609dae614261c1058785f217b72/150/150/UnapprovedImage/Png/noFilter"},"playing":10,"visitor":64600834,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-11-23T17:52:13.233Z","creator":{"name":"Kengun Omega","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":2951896419,"name":"general ragdoll chaos","desc":"🌟 previously: ragdoll simulator .rbxl\n🇷🇺 что-бы включить русский язык, нажми [P] и включи его там\n🎖 people with a premium subscription get a chat title and a coins multiplier\n😎 don't be a mortal and use R6 (R15's very broken)\n🤷 kind of supports both R6 and R15 though\n🎮 controls will appear in the chat when you join the game\n🛡️ join the official game group for a coins multiplier: www.roblox.com/groups/5282784\n(some of the glitches are intentional)\n\n👻 discontinued: the only changes made are going to be fixes of game-breaking bugs\n(this game is outdated, insecure, and n